the protocol spoken by Moonlight (https://moonlight-stream.org). The protocol's
behaviour was learned from its open implementations, Sunshine
(https://github.com/LizardByte/Sunshine) and moonlight-common-c
(https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-common-c), both GPL-3.0; no code
from either is included. "GameStream" and "NVIDIA" are trademarks of NVIDIA
